1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Remained a bachelor. He moved from Reichensachsen to Leipzig in 1852 and opened the bank HC Plaut, dealing with financing new railways and the expansion of the Eastern European economy, especially the development o
2 CONC f Leipziger Messe and the tobacco trading.  The establishment of the Jacob Plaut Hospital in 1865 earned him the honorary sitizenship. The Jacob Plaut Foundation in Leipzig Street near the Israweli cemetry was named after him.  Af
2 CONC ter retirement in 1875 he spent his last years in Nice. 
2 CONT
2 CONT www.wikipedia.org.../Oppenheimer
