1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Date/place of birth identified in Siegfried Wolf. ''Juden in Thüringen 1933-1945: Biographische Daten''. (2000), vol 1, p. 354
2 CONT * Identified as daughter of Leopold and Frieda Löbenstein in ,,Stolpersteine für deportierte jüdische Mühlhäuser Bürger," ''Thüringer Allgemeine'', 19.03.2013  
2 CONT * On 10 May 1942, Elfriede Löbenstein was deported with her mother from Weimar to Ghetto Belzyce. The transport arrived on 12 May 1942. See https://collections.arolsen-archives.org/en/search/person/128450602?s=Elfriede%20Löbenstei
2 CONC n%201921&t=245105&p=0
2 CONT * The Stolperstein for Elfriede Löbenstein states that she was murdered in the Majdanek KZ. 
2 CONT * Stolpersteine were laid for Leopold and Frieda Löbenstein in Mühlhausen in 2013. Stolpersteine were laid for Irmgard, Horst, Arno, Elfriede, und Liselotte Löbenstein in March 2015 in Mühlhausen/Thüringen; https://www.muehlhausen
2 CONC .de/rathaus-erkunden/erinnerungsorte/stolper.... See as well: http://muehlhausen.thueringer-allgemeine.de/web/lokal/politik/detai...
2 CONT German National Archives, ''Memorial Book'']':<br/>
2 CONT '''Löbenstein, Elfriede'''<br/>
2 CONT born on 28th April 1921 in Wanfried / Eschwege / Hessen-Nassau<br/>
2 CONT resident of Wanfried, Ahrensdorf and Mühlhausen i. Thüringen<br/>
2 CONT Deportation:<br/>
2 CONT from Weimar-Leipzig<br/>
2 CONT 10th May 1942, Belzyce, ghetto
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.muehlhausen.de/rathaus-erkunden/erinnerungsorte/stolpersteine-in-muehlhausen/herrenstrasse-5/#c24785
