1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Date/place of birth in record of his death; see  Landesarchiv Berlin; Berlin, Deutschland; Personenstandsregister Sterberegister (Ancestry.com).
2 CONT * Identified as son of Leopold and Frieda Löbenstein in death record cited above. 
2 CONT * There is confusion about the fate of Horst Löbenstein: The Stolperstein laid for him in Mühlhausen states that he was murdered in 1937 by the SA. However, there is an official record of his death in the Jewish hospital in Berlin
2 CONC  in the Landesarchiv Berlin; Berlin, Deutschland; Personenstandsregister Sterberegister (Ancestry.com).The entry for Horst Löbenstein in the database compiled by Dr. Siegfried Wolf. ''Juden in Thüringen 1933-1945: Biographische Da
2 CONC ten''. (2000), vol 1, p. 354also uses the 10 January 1940 death date, and adds the detail that Horst's "letzter Wohnsitz [war] Ausbildungslager Jessen bei Sommerfeld (https://www.niewerle.de/Juedische-Ausbildungslager-Schniebinche
2 CONC n-und-Jessen-NL); Jan. 1940 wegen Erkrankung Überführung in Jüd. Krankenhaus Berlin; that he was buried in Jewish Friedhof Weissensee of Berlin/Grab Nr. 102162. At this time (December 2023), there is no entry for Horst Löbenstein 
2 CONC in the German National Archives, ''Memorial Book''. 
2 CONT * A Stolperstein was laid for Horst Löbenstein in Mühlhausen in 2015. It states that Horst was murdered by the SA in 1937. 
2 CONT HIER WOHNTE
2 CONT HORST
2 CONT LÖBENSTEIN
2 CONT JG. 1922
2 CONT '''VON SA
2 CONT ERMORDET 1937'''
