1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Minka Lamm was born in Nentershausen, Hesse in 1780.  She married Falk Eliel around 1816. They had 6 children, all born in Iba, Hesse. Their fifth child, Louis Eliel, married the daughter of Taubchen Lamm Danziger,
2 CONC  Minka Lamm's sister. We are descended from Louis, and also from Minka and Falk's youngest child, Jeremiah. Minka Lamm Eliel died Dec. 15, 1843 in Iba.
