1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Loved chocolate, sunsets, and her family....not necessarily in that order.  She loved living in Florida--moved there in 1958--and was the perennial optimist.  When she was escaping Europe in 1940, she considered th
2 CONC e boat from Antwerp to New York as her first "cruise"!
