1 NAME Falk /Eliel/
2 GIVN Falk
2 _MARNM Eliel
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1785
1 DEAT
2 DATE 3 MAR 1862
2 PLAC Iba
2 ADDR
3 CITY Bebra
3 STAE Hessen
3 CTRY Germany
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Falk Eliel was born in 1785,  in  Hesse. He was  the son of Levy Eliel who was born around 1750 and married to Johanna Levy. That couple had three sons, Leib Levy Eliel, born in 1779, Abraham Levy Eliel, born in 17
2 CONC 81, and Falk Eliel, born in 1785.   Falk named his first son Levi and his first daughter Johanna.
2 CONT
2 CONT Falk Eliel  married Minka Eliel, daughter of Lamm Eliel of Iba, Hesse, and Hanna Plaut of Reichensachsen.   Falk and Minka Eliel had 6 children, all born in Iba.  We are descended from two of them - Louis and Jeremiah.  German rec
2 CONC ords list Falk Eliel as a trader. Family legend is that his work was in some way connected to the brewery in Iba. Minka Lamm Eliel died Dec. 15, 1843 in Iba.  Her youngest child, Jeremiah, was 15 years old at the time. Falk Eliel 
2 CONC died March 3, 1862 in Iba.  All of his children, except the oldest - Levi Eliel - had immigrated to America in the 1850's. 
