2 CONT http://db.yadvashem.org/names/nameDetails.html?itemId=4428701&language=en Rosa Wetzlar nee Rosenstock was born in Gersfeld, Germany in 1871 to Sara. Prior to WWII she lived in Frankfurt am Main, Germany. During the war she was in 
2 CONC Teresienstadt, Ghetto. Rosa was murdered/perished in 1942 in the Shoah. This information is based on a Page of Testimony (displayed on left) submitted by her daughter.
