1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Esther Berlin-Joel''' (also known as '''Esther Berli-Joel''', '''Esther Barli-Joel''', Hebrew: '''אסתר ברלין-יואל'''; May 2, 1895 – March 7, 1972) was a German-born Israeli painter and graphic designer. She desi
