1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Hermann Herrey was the father of one son by his first marriage, and a second son from his 2nd marriage.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT A native of Vienna, Hermann Herrey (born 4 April 1904 as Hermann Zweigenthal) was educated in Vienna and Berlin, and worked as a stage designer in Germany and England before coming to the United States in 1940, at the invitation o
2 CONC f Walter Gropius. Herrey adapted and rewrote modern and classical plays and translated other plays into English and German; designed stage sets and costumes; and lectured at colleges and universities, including Harvard University,
2 CONC  McGill University, Yale University, Queens College and The American Academy of Arts and Sciences. 
2 CONT
2 CONT See http://de.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hermann_Zweigenthal
