1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Brief Life History of Heinemann changed to Heinrich David
2 CONT When Heinemann changed to Heinrich David Dellevie was born from 1801 to 1802, in Melsungen, Hesse-Nassau, Prussia, Germany, his father, David Levi post mortem ka David Dellevie, was 30 and his mother, Süse Dellevie, was 25. He had
2 CONC  at least 6 sons and 1 daughter with Johanna "Hannchen" Josua. He died on 26 August 1877, in Hamburg, Germany.
