2 CONT marriage Samuel Morgenstern, he was widower  https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000141148848429
2 CONT
2 CONT Nina Leitner (mother of Helene) died 17 March 1907. Her obituary does not mention Hermann (but does mention Helene Morgenstern).  This suggests that Hermann married to Helene Leitner died before 17 March 1907.
2 CONT
2 CONT The obituary in the link below suggests that the Hermann Morgenstern married to Helene Leitner died before 1911.
2 CONT
2 CONT there are several Morgenstern Hermann suppose the Hermann married to Helene/Nelly, nee Leitner, died before 1911, the obit mentions only sibling Imre, Ernst, and Helene(Morgenstern) Adele (Perger) and sister in law Emma Leitner
2 CONT
2 CONT suppose husband died before, no children; Nelly was buried in Brunn/Brno; http://anno.onb.ac.at/cgi-content/anno?apm=0&aid=nfp&datum=19110104&seite=20&zoom=2
2 CONT
2 CONT Hermann Morgenstern married to Helene Leitner (marriage date 1872) can not be the same as the father to Hans Julius born 1909 Lfdnr 113572 Jahr 1872 Reihenzahl 219 Code 2
