1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Brother of the Skoczów tanner and industrialist https://www.geni.com/people/David-Spitzer/6000000021455994839, according to ''In the Shadow of the Skoczów Synagogue''; Bielsko-Biała 1994 (Polish; Janusz Spyra) and 
2 CONC 1998 (English translation; tr. Jakub Sławek)
2 CONT
2 CONT Listed as living in Cieszyn in 1910 in ''In the Shadow of the Skoczów Synagogue''; Bielsko-Biała 1994 (Polish; Janusz Spyra) and 1998 (English translation; tr. Jakub Sławek).
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://halinaszotek.ox.pl/media/upload/2019/11/13/WRZESIE%C5%83%202019.pdf This source (Polish)] confirms that Nathan was the older brother of David and Aron Spitzer, and that Nathan’s money in tanning helped David settle in Sko
2 CONC czów. Nathan was in business with his brothers-in-law https://www.geni.com/people/Joseph-Altmann/6000000222578781823 and https://www.geni.com/people/Albert-Abraham-Altman/6000000021464630915, and money from this venture helped him
2 CONC  locate his brother David to Skotschau. 
