1 NOTE {geni:about_me} eopold Plaut, originally from Witzenhausen, moved to Kassel in 1870 at age 17. He trained in banking and worked at the company Aschrott. In 1883, he married Henriette Katzensstein, a doctor's daughter, and later co
2 CONC -founded a private bank with Otto Katzensstein, a relative of Henriette.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had three children: Käthchen (1884), Maximilian (1888), and Ernst (1894).
2 CONT
2 CONT The bank, "Plaut & Co", was located at Kurfürstenstraße 6 and was relatively successful, employing three staff members at the turn of the century.
