2 CONC Fabriken in Marienthal, Hameln (3 years technical school), followed by Webschukle, Achen? 1905-6 and 4 years study in USA. ≤/p>≤p>≤p>≤/p>≤/p>≤p>≤p>Albert founded a carpet factory in Hameln Germany in August 1910 with his partner E
