1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.famillebutlerdelarochelle.com/devries.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Clara Dalberg was born on September 29, 1877 in Niedermarsberg. On August 18, 1899, she married the tradesman Louis de Vries, born on March 31, 1874 in Rotterdam,then a resident of Amsterdam. She was one of eight sisters.
2 CONT
2 CONT When Holland was invaded on 10 May 1940, Lex fell on the third day of hostilities. Clara passed away a few days earlier . After that, being Jewish , Louis kept a low profile, and finally was taken into the safe harbour of a cathol
2 CONC ic convent in the little village of Eerde in South Holland. His health had been badly affected by the tragic simultaneous loss of his wife and elder son, and a broken man he never left the convent until his death in 1958. 
2 CONT
