1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sophie(Sophia)was born on September 3, 1879 in Niedermarsberg. On February 2, 1900, she married the tradesman Samuel de Vries, born October 1 1872, in Rotteram, and resident of the Hague (they divorced 1912).
