3 CONT RiP
3 CONT
3 CONT an honest and upright man, diligent all his days.
3 CONT
3 CONT This is Daniel, son of the venerable gentleman Me'ir
3 CONT
3 CONT Brandenstein.
3 CONT
3 CONT He died at the age of sixty-four
3 CONT
3 CONT on Thursday, March 16th,
3 CONT
3 CONT and was buried on Sunday, March 19th,
3 CONT
3 CONT in the year 624 AD. k. Z. (= died October 29, 1863).
3 CONT
3 CONT
3 CONT May his soul be bound in the bond of life, Amen.
