1 NOTE {geni:about_me} June 6th, 1944 (D Day): Carl took part on the D day during WW II, disembarking on the 2nd wave that landed at Omaha Beach.  From his boat, most were killed prior having the chance to disembark.  He took the chance 
2 CONC and jumped to the stern of the boat, remaining alive. Later he was wounded twice during the war without great sequels.
2 CONT
2 CONT During subsequent years, lived in the USA (Miami) and in Spain where acted on several films, including the 'Battle of the Bulge'.
