1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jean was a unique person who was self taught. Being a girl, she was not allowed to attend college but continued to educate herself well after the few courses she took in High School. She used to read the Wall Stree
2 CONC t Journal and then use the paper to cut out patterns for clothing she was making. Always the practical woman, she would give us new pencils with our name on it for each holiday - environmental and useful - and hard to lose! From h
2 CONC er 14th floor apartment (truly 13the floor but the building didn't have a flood with this number), an environmentalist at an early age, she watched to make sure the local smoke stacks were abiding by the rules and would report any
2 CONC  building that exceeded their furnace burning time. A wonderful grandmother who used to walk and climb, in heals, the rocks in Central Park. Very active in the Reconstructionist and Zionist movements in the 1970's. 
