2 CONT * Carl Katzenstein was arrested in the Kristallnachtpogrom of 9/10 November 1938 and imprisoned in Buchenwald KZ. He was released on 29 November 1928. See Arolsen Archives record at https://collections.arolsen-archives.org/en/sear
