2 CONT * He met with the Enemy Aliens Tribunal board in November 1939 and was declared exempt from internment; see ''The National Archives; Kew, London, England; 1939 Register;'' Reference: Rg 101/244e
2 CONT * on 19 December 1939, Karl and Minna Katzenstein left England, immigrating into the USA at New York on 27 Dec 1939. Source: Ancestry.com. ''New York, Passenger Lists, 1820-1957'' [database on-line]. Provo, UT, USA: Ancestry.com O
