2 CONT Residing in Duderstadt and in Hamburg
2 CONT Deportation from Hamburg 25th October 1941, Litzmannstadt (Lodz), Ghetto
2 CONT Date of death 00. May 1942, Kulmhof (Chelmno), Vernichtungslager
2 CONT Place of death Kulmhof (Chelmno), Vernichtungslager
