1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Elizabeth "Lisa" Regina Roettgen, 91, formerly of 900 W. 190th St., New York City, died Tuesday at Sweet Brook Care Center, where she had resided since 1995.
2 CONT
2 CONT Born in Bochum, Germany, on Feb. 1, 1908, daughter of Dr. Ernest Herz and Johanna Dalberg Herz, she attended schools in Germany.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs. Roettgen married Felix Roettgen in 1930, and lived in Wattenscheid, Germany, until moving to the United States in 1938, settling in New York. Her husband predeceased her.
2 CONT
2 CONT She worked as an administrative assistant at the YWCA and the YJCA in New York until her retirement in 1965. After retirement, she remained active with volunteer work in social and elderly agencies in New York. She moved to Willia
2 CONC mstown in 1995.
