1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Birth: Apr., 1949 
2 CONT * Death: Apr. 25, 2010
2 CONT
2 CONT Judith M. Hirsch, Ph.D., 61, died peacefully on April 25, 2010, at her home in San Francisco, surrounded by her family. She had pancreatic cancer.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was born in Chicago, Il. to Lotte Hirsch and the late Walter Hirsch of West Lafayette, Indiana. She was the sister of Martin (Joyce) Hirsch, of Glendale, California; Janet (Dan) Wittenberg, of Bethesda, Md. and Dan Hirsch, of 
2 CONC Oakland, California. She was an aunt to Amy and Jenna Hirsch; Alexandra, Jamie and Andrew Wittenberg and Leo, Julia and Sophia Hirsch. 
2 CONT
