1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Birth in Szaki, [Sakiai] Wladyslawow, Suwalki on October 30, 1836 of 
2 CONT
2 CONT * HENIGSON, Hirsz	 to Chaim and Bluma  		
2 CONT
2 CONT Record: Szaki / [Sakiai] 1836 M39 	Not filmed /   LVIA/1236/6/2.  Source: Jewish Gen 
2 CONT
2 CONT His daughter Chana Rejzel Henigson Bardyni was born on July 25, 1862.  He would have been 26 years old then.
2 CONT
2 CONT His wife's name was Basia Orelowa according to JRI-P (Jewish Gen) records for her daughter from Augustow.  Meaning Basia, daughter of Orel (Aharon)?
2 CONT
2 CONT His daughter Chana Rejzel was living in Augustow, Suwalki, Poland at the turn of the century where her daughters Bluma Rochla and Fejga were born.  Notice that Bluma is named for her grandmother, Bluma.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Came to U.S. in ca. 1880, became citizen ca. 1885.  Arrived on SS Westphalia at Castle Garden, Manhattan.  (record on Ancestry)
2 CONT
2 CONT His wife, Basia, came to U.S. in ca. 1890. (record on Ancestry)
